up a tiny forge just above your taskbar. Every key you press is one swing of his hammer. When you pause he wipes his brow and takes a sip, and when you go for a coffee he naps on his stool. Brygida sells what he makes in their shop, and you discover new patterns as you go. The game counts key presses, never what you type, and works offline. The demo takes you through copper a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989440-1845383656395880","game_id":"steam-4989440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.4.7: Brokk keeps hammering while you play","summary":"Thank you for being here and for your reports in the Bug Reporting thread. This update is built on them. Mouse clicks count again while a game is fullscreen, so Brokk keeps forging whether you play with the keyboard or the mouse. The forge now has a taskbar button and an Alt+Tab entry. Pick it there to bring the forge up over your game, then click back into the game and it steps aside again. Need the forge out of the way? \"Minimize the forge\" in Settings, or a click on its taskbar button, tucks ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:03:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989440-1845383656377424","game_id":"steam-4989440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.4.6: Brokk makes room for fullscreen Steam games and apps","summary":"Thank you for being here and for your reports in the Bug Reporting thread. This small update fixes both problems described there. The forge now hides while a game or video is fullscreen on its monitor. Games stay in fullscreen and the mouse no longer escapes to a second monitor. Prefer to see it over the game? Turn on \"Show over fullscreen apps\" in Settings, Display tab. Your progress carries over unchanged. Any comments or wishes? Let me know in the Steam discussions. If they come in soon, I wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:34:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989440-1844751498219240","game_id":"steam-4989440","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is available now!","summary":"Hi everyone, The free demo of My Desktop Dwarf: Taskbar Forge is now available on Steam! I'm really excited to be writing that sentence. I'm one man developer and I'm really happy to share this little game with you. The idea I wanted to bring to life was simple: a small companion to keep you company during an ordinary day at your keyboard. Of course, there are already complanions like that on Steam, but nither of them was what I would acctually wanted on my desktop, so I decided to create one. S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T17:59:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989440-1844115010505523","game_id":"steam-4989440","kind":"announcement","title":"100 wishlists. Thank you!","summary":"Hello everyone! My Desktop Dwarf: Taskbar Forge has passed its first 100 wishlists! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46282494/594fb0a84aab5ac9a71352dcdfc530337d27bda6.png To everyone who added the game, shared the page, or stopped by to see what Brokk is up to: thank you. For a little dwarf setting up shop above your taskbar, that's a pretty big welcome. I'm making My Desktop Dwarf: Taskbar Forge under the name Press Any Key. It's a desktop companion where your typing drives Brokk's hammer. He forges items, B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T22:13:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505523","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4989440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4989440":"2026-10-26T05:55:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4989440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5167500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4989440","app_id":4989440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:14Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2a32f24d98fe4478b65c124c86cd3480cdaa89715c73aeb21632dfa5914ef359","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"작업 표시줄 바로 위, 드워프 브로크가 작은 대장간을 차렸습니다. 당신이 키를 두드리면 그는 망치를 휘두릅니다. 대개는 편자나 주전자, 가끔은 전설의 검도 나옵니다. 파는 일은 아내 브리기다, 두 사람의 가게에서. 타자를 치면 브로크가 쇠를 벼립니다. 둘이 함께라면 일은 더 빠르고 즐겁게 굴러갑니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Press Any Key","creator_clan_account_id":46126341}],"developers":[{"name":"Press Any Key","creator_clan_account_id":46126341}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"hig